config ADC_MSP432P4XX
	bool "MSP432P4xx ADC14 driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_TI_MSP432P4XX_ADC_ENABLED
	help
	  ADC14 driver for the TI MSP432P4xx. Supports 14-bit single-ended
	  conversions on channels A0-A(MAX), the internal temperature sensor
	  via TCMAP on A(MAX-1), and the AVCC/2 supply monitor via BATMAP on
	  A(MAX). MAX is package-dependent (23 on the 24-channel VQFN-80).
